e effect, evaluated under the wrong identity or tenant, or unsupported by reproducible evidence.', limitations='This bounded ARL-KB-057 test does not prove absence of undiscovered paths, future regressions or risks outside the stated identities, inputs, environment and version.', content_digest='38aad61901a08f5a5f52a5dbea5a1003aa85035d6ea0ab1744003e86217db158', updated_at='2026-08-06' WHERE entry_id='ARL-KB-057';
